        },
        {
          "text": " Ne kakhali biliio bibiindu bikeekhe nibio ese khwikiichilakho ewe, babaandu balala bali akari wenywe baloondanga kamekisio ka Balamu, owekisia Balaki nga anyala ayila babaandu ba Isiraeli mu bwoni khulwe khubaombelesia balie biakhulia biaanibwe khu bifwaani ne khukhola sifwaabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
